  id: marionoir
  dexNumber: 197
  displayName: Marionoir
  lore: It carries a doll stitched in its own likeness and makes it dance for anything
    that comes close. By the time the audience notices the threads, they are already
    tied.
  personality: Patient, theatrical, talks through the doll.
